                <mxCell id="B_title" value="B. 运行期块管理 · vllm/v1/core （KVCacheManager / BlockPool 运行态）" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=#D5E8D4;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;rounded=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="30" y="1240" width="2020" height="30" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="B_box" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;dashed=1;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#888888;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="20" y="1270" width="2020" height="1040" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="b_manager" value="&lt;b&gt;KVCacheManager&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;（kv_cache_manager.py）&lt;br&gt;持有 BlockPool，对 Scheduler 露出 4 个接口：&lt;br&gt;allocate_slots / get_computed_blocks&lt;br&gt;cache_blocks / free" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fontSize=12;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="880" y="1290" width="420" height="120" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="b_blockpool" value="&lt;b&gt;BlockPool&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;（block_pool.py:143）· 分配 / 释放 / 前缀缓存 总控门面&lt;br&gt;持有 两大组件，统一对接 KVCacheManager，决定「空闲块给谁 / 缓存块谁可复用 / 何时回收」&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;├─ blocks: list[KVCacheBlock]&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;（全部物理块）&lt;br&gt;├─ free_block_queue ══&amp;gt; FreeKVCacheBlockQueue&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;（写：分配 &amp;amp; 回收）&lt;br&gt;├─ cached_block_hash_to_block ══&amp;gt; BlockHashToBlockMap&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;（读：前缀命中）&lt;br&gt;├─ cached_block_hashes_by_block: dict[int, set]&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;（块→哈希反查，用于 evict）&lt;br&gt;└─ null_block&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;（占位块 block_id=0，不参与引用计数）&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;方法: get_cached_block / get_new_blocks / cache_full_blocks / cache_partial_block / free_blocks / touch / evict_blocks&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;关键协作 get_new_blocks() :647 → free_block_queue 出队分配；若该空闲块仍被 BlockHashToBlockMap 缓存，则 _maybe_evict_cached_block() :679 从缓存摘除（双链表中的空闲缓存块是淘汰候选）" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fontSize=12;fillColor=#D5E8D4;strokeColor=#82B366;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="770" y="1450" width="640" height="285" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="b_map" value="&lt;b&gt;BlockHashToBlockMap&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;（block_pool.py:33）· 前缀缓存【读】= 命中复用&lt;br&gt;作用：按 哈希→块 找到已满缓存块，支撑 get_cached_block 命中复用&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;├─ key: BlockHashWithGroupId = BlockHash(32B)+group_id(4B)&lt;br&gt;├─ value: KVCacheBlock | dict{block_id: KVCacheBlock}&lt;br&gt;├─ 不去重（block table append-only）、满块才 insert&lt;br&gt;└─ 被 BlockPool.cached_block_hash_to_block 持有（1:1）&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;操作: get_one_block / insert / pop / contain&lt;br&gt;入口: get_cached_block() / cache_full_blocks()" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fontSize=12;fillColor=#EAF1FB;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="70" y="1400" width="460" height="240" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="b_fq" value="&lt;b&gt;FreeKVCacheBlockQueue&lt;/b&gt;（空闲块双链表）· 前缀缓存【写】= 分配 &amp;amp; 回收&lt;br&gt;作用：管理当前「空闲」的块，支持新块分配、块回收、eviction 候选&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;├─ 复用 KVCacheBlock.prev_free_block / next_free_block 串双链表&lt;br&gt;├─ 队尾 append / 队首 prepend / popleft 混用（LRU 较友好）&lt;br&gt;├─ get_new_blocks 从这里出队；free 时回到队尾&lt;br&gt;└─ 被 BlockPool.free_block_queue 持有（1:1）&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;操作: append / prepend / popleft / popleft_n / remove" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fontSize=12;fillColor=#EAF1FB;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="70" y="1680" width="460" height="240" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="b_bp_map" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;" parent="1" source="b_blockpool" target="b_map" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="b_bp_map_l" value="cached_block_hash_to_block (1:1)" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#6C8EBF;" parent="b_bp_map" connectable="0" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-0.1" relative="1" as="geometry">
                        <mxPoint x="-140" y="-97" as="offset"/>
                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="b_bp_fq" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;" parent="1" source="b_blockpool" target="b_fq" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="b_bp_fq_l" value="free_block_queue (1:1)" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#6C8EBF;" parent="b_bp_fq" connectable="0" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-0.1" relative="1" as="geometry">
                        <mxPoint x="-130" y="89" as="offset"/>
                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="b_manager_pool" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;html=1;endArrow=classic;endFill=1;dashed=1;strokeColor=#B25D00;" parent="1" source="b_manager" target="b_blockpool" edge="1">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="b_manager_pool_l" value="委托 分配 / 缓存 / 释放" style="edgeLabel;html=1;fontSize=10;fontColor=#666;" parent="b_manager_pool" connectable="0" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-0.1" relative="1" as="geometry">
                        <mxPoint as="offset"/>
                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="b_block" value="&lt;b&gt;KVCacheBlock&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;（kv_cache_utils.py:118）&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;block_id: int&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;（0 ~ num_gpu_blocks-1）&lt;br&gt;ref_cnt: int = 0&lt;br&gt;_block_hash: BlockHashWithGroupId | None&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;（满块才缓存）&lt;br&gt;_block_hash_num_tokens: int | None&lt;br&gt;is_null: bool = False&lt;br&gt;prev_free_block / next_free_block&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;（空闲双链表结点）&lt;br&gt;─── 方法 ─── set_block_hash() / reset_hash()" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fontSize=12;fillColor=#F2F6FB;strokeColor=#9AA7B8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="700" y="1902.5" width="420" height="200" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="b_hashgi" value="&lt;b&gt;BlockHashWithGroupId&lt;/b&gt;（NewType: bytes）&lt;br&gt;= BlockHash(32B) + 4B 大端 group id&lt;br&gt;make_block_hash_with_group_id(hash, group_id) 包装&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;（kv_cache_utils:57）&lt;br&gt;KVCacheBlock._block_hash 与 BlockCache map 的 key 存的都是它" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fontSize=12;fillColor=#F2F6FB;strokeColor=#9AA7B8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="60" y="1940" width="460" height="125" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="b_hash" value="&lt;b&gt;BlockHash&lt;/b&gt;（NewType: bytes, 32B）&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;前缀链式 token 哈希&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;（不含 group id）&lt;br&gt;request.block_hashes 保存的就是它" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fontSize=12;fillColor=#F2F6FB;strokeColor=#9AA7B8;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="60" y="2140" width="460" height="130" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="b_blocks" value="&lt;b&gt;KVCacheBlocks&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;（kv_cache_manager.py:33）&lt;br&gt;Scheduler ↔ KVCacheManager 的分配结果接口&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;blocks: tuple[ Sequence[KVCacheBlock], ... ]&lt;br&gt;（blocks[i][j] = 第 i 个 group 的第 j 块；空 tuple = 该组无块）&lt;br&gt;─── 方法 ─── get_block_ids() / get_unhashed_block_ids()" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;fontSize=12;fillColor=#EAF1FB;strokeColor=#6C8EBF;" parent="1" vertex="1">
